# Always Deploy

After any substantive change to this FORGE Public Safety RMS app, always finish by building and deploying to Firebase hosting.

## Deploy steps

From the project root:

```powershell
npm run build
firebase deploy --only hosting
```

## When to deploy

- Deploy after feature work, bug fixes, styling changes, or config updates that affect the live site.
- Do not skip deploy and leave changes local-only unless the user explicitly asks not to deploy.
- If build fails, fix the error and retry deploy before considering the task complete.

## Target

- Project: `rms-dashboard-7562e`
- Live URL: https://rms.forgepublicsafety.com
